  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"De\u011Fnek \xDC\xE7l\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\"
    se\xE7tin.\n\nGeni\u015F ve detayl\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCnmen gereken, ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131
    \xE7ok b\xFCy\xFCk dikkatle atman gereken bir zamandas\u0131n. B\xF6yle yapman\u0131n
    getirileri b\xFCy\xFCk olacak. Kart\u0131n ise, tam tersi bir portre \xE7izdi\u011Fini
    s\xF6yl\xFCyor {{isim}}. Yarat\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n baltaland\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Problem \xE7\xF6zme yetene\u011Finde \u015Fu s\u0131ralar azalma
    var. Geni\u015F d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCp ak\u0131lc\u0131 \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F
    yollar\u0131 bulam\u0131yorsun. \u0130stedi\u011Fin sonu\xE7lara ula\u015Famay\u0131nca
    da muhtemelen \u015Fanss\u0131z oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorsun. Sevdi\u011Fin
    \u015Feylerle arana giren p\xFCr\xFCzler var. Umutlar\u0131na \xE7\u0131kan yollar
    sisli g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor. Hepsini bertaraf edebilecek ekipmana ise sahipsin.
    Kendi tarz\u0131n\u0131 ortaya koy ve harekete ge\xE7.\n"
